released as a motion picture in 2024  aFull screen8 aMPA rating: R; for sexual content, some graphic nudity, language, sexual assault, and drug use  aThe Apprentice is a dive into the underbelly of the American empire. It charts a young Donald Trump's ascent to power through a Faustian deal with the influential right-wing lawyer and political fixer Roy Cohn10aTrump, Donald,d1946-vDrama.10aCohn, Roy M.vDrama. 0aBusinessmenzNew York (State)zNew YorkvDrama. 7aBiographical films.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2011026089 7aHistorical films.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2011026311 7aFeature films.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2011026247 7aFiction films.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2011026250 7aVideo recordings for the hearing impaired.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2011026725 7aFilms biographiques.2rvmgf 7aFilms historiques.2rvmgf 7aFilms de fiction.2rvmgf1 aAbbasi, Ali,d1981-efilm director,efilm producer.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no20190326201https://id.oclc.org/worldcat/entity/E39PBJtCGRfdbCMWbxhMkPwHmd1 aSherman, Gabriel,escreenwriter.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no20140096461https://id.oclc.org/worldcat/entity/E39PBJghkcMFCctTfbPTFXR9Xd1 aBekerman, Daniel,efilm producer.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no20160690091https://id.oclc.org/worldcat/entity/E39PCjG86XRyVv87qT47bffYvb1 aJarek, Jacob,efilm producer.1 aTreacy, Ruth,efilm producer.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no20170000641https://id.oclc.org/worldcat/entity/E39PCjKPdwVQdmFmd3bwtQ3rVP1 aForde, Julianne,efilm producer.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no20171518081https://id.oclc.org/worldcat/entity/E39PCjDhw9xBPQ76967q3htjwd1 aTisné, Louis,efilm producer.1 aStan, Sebastian,d1982-eactor.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n20070805391https://id.oclc.org/worldcat/entity/E39PBJcBVDCDjQD8VQFPcQdmh31