in the world's most powerful military that he will soon lead again, at least nominally. But Trump's radicality and pathological intensity in courting chaos threatens more than just military structure or policy, and is not only about the already fragile concepts of "truth" and "facts," but about a much higher order where reality itself is structured. Developing literacy in this domain will be essential for geopolitics in the difficult years ahead. Editorial Editors Genealogies of Autonomy Sven Lütticken and Marina Vishmidt in conversation Society of the Psyop, Part 3: Cognition and Chaos Trevor Paglen The Sun of the Colored Peoples: Edival Ramosa in the Diaspora André Pitol Unsettled Ghosts in Ex-Africa: Okwui Enwezor's Second International Biennial of Contemporary Art Seville Jason Waite Without Claims to Purity: The Great Atomic Bombreflector and Its Designers Anna Gorskaya Disperse the Nation: Don Mee Choi's Poetry Trilogy Alan Gilbert The Snag in the Voice Sophie Rose"--cprovided by distributor  aStandard Copyright10aArt museum curators.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh8600190310aArtificial intelligence.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh8500818010aCritical theory.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh8800245610aElectronic surveillance in art.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh200300004610aElectronic surveillance.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh8600664110aMilitary-industrial complex.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh8800156910aMuseums--Curatorship.10aPerformance art.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh8509980910aPhilosophy.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh8510084910aSculpture.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh8511900417aArtificial intelligence.2fast0(OCoLC)fst008172470http://id.worldcat.org/fast/81724717aCritical theory.2fast0(OCoLC)fst008836900http://id.worldcat.org/fast/88369017aCuratorship.2fast0(OCoLC)fst010301490http://id.worldcat.org/fast/189339717aCurators.2fast0(OCoLC)fst0081562417aElectronic surveillance.2fast0(OCoLC)fst009074770http://id.worldcat.org/fast/90747717aMilitary-industrial complex.2fast0(OCoLC)fst010216050http://id.worldcat.org/fast/102160517aPerformance art.2fast0(OCoLC)fst010578520http://id.worldcat.org/fast/105785217aPhilosophy.2fast0(OCoLC)fst010607770http://id.worldcat.org/fast/106077717aSculpture.2fast0(OCoLC)fst011094830http://id.worldcat.org/fast/110948317aSurveillance in art.2fast0(OCoLC)fst009074830http://id.worldcat.org/fast/2009993 7aPeriodicals.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026139 7aPeriodicals.2fast0(OCoLC)fst014116410http://id.worldcat.org/fast/14116411 aAndrews, Michael,eeditor.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n850118601 aAranda, Julieta,eeditor,econtributor.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no20061296571 aFlorin, Adam,econtributor.1 aGilbert, Alan,econtributor.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n882861491 aGorskaya, Anna,econtributor.1 aLütticken, Sven,econtributor.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/nr20040219161 aMoses, Serubiri,eeditor.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no20191245191 aNguyễn, Minh,eeditor.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n980829811 aPaglen, Trevor,econtributor.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no20061125021 aPetrossiants, Andreas,eeditor.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no20181752121 aPitol, André,econtributor.1 aQian, Mengyi,econtributor.1 aRamsey, Jeff,econtributor.1 aRose, Sophie,econtributor.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n20230152181 aSit, Peter,econtributor.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no20240306961 aVafai, Keyian,econtributor.1 aVidokle, Anton,eeditor,econtributor.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no20061296551 aVishmidt, Marina,econtributor.1 aWaite, Jason,econtributor.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no20191752921 aWhite, Simone,eeditor.0http://id.loc.gov/a