chés de vieillesse.pAlbum italiano.pPasseggiata.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n8781118512aRossini, Gioacchino,d1792-1868.tPéchés de vieillesse.pMiscellanée de musique vocale.pChanson du bébé.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no9301742712aRossini, Gioacchino,d1792-1868.tPéchés de vieillesse.kSelections.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n9302796512aRossini, Gioacchino,d1792-1868.tDuetto buffo di due gatti.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n8865319512aRossini, Gioacchino,d1792-1868.tSoirées musicales.pDanza;oarranged.  aRobert Baxter collection  aSUL/MUSIC/catalogedby/Flourish-WS/202411  aSUL/MUSIC/gift/kevkishi/20241205/Baxter  b36105234605702cMCD 74391n2lMusic PAGE-MU (MUS-PAGE-MU)  aC0bSTFffsda9139f5-bcb8-49ce-9eb0-e2ca9fcc2c65i3bc52f50-1708-43fd-b93d-de13fc6d216b08941nam a2201273ui in0000030177420250403135108.0a||||go|||||||||||cr mn|---uuuuu250116s2018||||xx ||||go|||||||| u|eng|d  als187916  aNYHLSbengerdacNYHLSdCstdUtOrBLW00aGlossary of Common Knowledge 1a[Place of publication not identified] :bMG+MSUM,c2018  a1 online resource  atextbtxt2rdacontent  acomputerbc2rdamedia  aonline resourcebcr2rdacarrier  aArchived and cataloged by Library Stack  aUnrestricted online access  a"The Glossary of Common Knowledge (GCK) is a compilation of art terminology that differs substantially from what is found in the existing literature on art, and constitutes a five-year research project conducted by Moderna galerija (MG+MSUM), in the framework of L'Internationale's program The Uses of Art. In collaboration with institutions and individuals from Europe and other parts of the world, 66 contributors/narrators proposed terms relating to their own practices and contexts, to historical references, political or social situations, or L'Internationale projects. The terms were discussed and defined in six seminars dealing with six referential fields (historicization, subjectivization, geopolitics, constituencies, commons and their institutionality) and the book follows these topics across six chapters. Narrators created a plurality of voices and narratives which examine the proposed terms and add their different viewpoints, bringing with them overlooked, suppressed knowledge and also non-Western categories of thought and memories. This method gave rise to different ways of participating, sharing and using knowledge, as well as working together trans-globally."--cprovided by distributor  aStandard Copyright10aArt, Modern--21st century.10aCritical theory.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh8800245610aGeopolitics.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh8505419210aHistoriography.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh8506121110aInformation commons.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/subjects/sh200600638017aContemporary Art.2fast0(OCoLC)fst0115982017aCritical theory.2fast0(OCoLC)fst008836900http://id.worldcat.org/fast/88369017aGeopolitics.2fast0(OCoLC)fst009410450http://id.worldcat.org/fast/94104517aHistoriography.2fast0(OCoLC)fst009582210http://id.worldcat.org/fast/95822117aInformation commons.2fast0(OCoLC)fst017652060http://id.worldcat.org/fast/1765206 7aDiscursive works.2lcgft0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2014026089 7aEssay Collection.2fast0(OCoLC)fst014240321 aAikens, Nick,econtributor.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no20130278331 aAkšamija, Azra,econtributor.1 aArıkan, Burak,econtributor.1 aArsanios, Marwa,econtributor.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/ns20150038301 aBadovinac, Zdenka,ecurator,econtributor.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n950683061 aBoynik, Sezgin,econtributor.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no20090886151 aBuden, Boris,econtributor.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/n980184331 aButt, Zoe,econtributor.0http://id.loc.gov/authorities/names/no20161110871 aByrne, John,econtributor.0http://id.loc.gov/auth